{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f8beffbf9ab127997509899621ea84ec4df466f1978a103d7c888349e7347857", "ja": "（映画『アイドルスペースウォーズ』シリーズの\n最新作の撮影が、いよいよ今日から始まるぞ！）", "zh": "（电影《偶像太空战争》系列最新作的拍摄，终于要从今天开始了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1001_p", "source_sha256": "461591b3b9cde55c6f07e6a1514d5bbfb665bbe9423d30f840a0c2198a65af51", "ja": "（このみさんが演じるのは、冒険艦『馬場』の艦長。\n宇宙の荒くれ者たち、クルーを束ねるリーダーだ）", "zh": "（木实小姐饰演的是冒险舰『马场』的舰长。是统领宇宙亡命之徒们，也就是船员们的领袖）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "67f0e71c38a9921c337bd554465a32cdbbb6d3efb0c54025aed8d4a66e2e8945", "ja": "{$P$}、ついに始まるわね！\nメイクも着替えもバッチリだし、いつでもいけるわ♪", "zh": "{$P$}，终于要开始了呢！\n妆也化好了，衣服也换好了，随时都可以上♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ed53f3eebb8b131f1cf0743ba0c8b6ea5f06df1f4075e7055617f32465af1f7e", "ja": "お疲れさまです。気合い入ってますね！", "zh": "辛苦了。干劲十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "904a0ca617c34f272034059c54b8a1674f52d29f40df17c3f9cda4136db9f295", "ja": "ふふっ。期待の大きい作品だもの。\nみんなのためにも、劇場のためにも、頑張らなくちゃ。", "zh": "呵呵。毕竟是部备受期待的作品嘛。\n为了大家，也为了剧场，我可得努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "f835442668157611e517cf7e8772a686275a577dd1bfdc1002a43fff6f35310c", "ja": "それに私、やっぱりこの役が好きなの。\nやり手で、でもすごく情に厚いところもあって。", "zh": "而且，我果然还是喜欢这个角色。\n她精明能干，但也有非常重感情的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3c832020a574ff2dd7b28934eac110cc39a0144e303b3574d0088972c2c45e43", "ja": "そうですね。お金にがめついフリしてますけど、\nつい人助けを優先してしまうような……。", "zh": "是啊。虽然装作很爱钱的样子，但总会不由自主地优先帮助别人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "5d4f5f2fe07669c5f1bd94e48d477d3ab1ea459e0f7732dcd6f2a04fab2cd27e", "ja": "そうそう！　面倒見がいいって言うか……。\nただアダルティなだけじゃないのが魅力よね～！", "zh": "对对！该说是很会照顾人吗……不只是成熟而已，这正是她的魅力呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "aadf9e66a5bc12b20dfd543512f684cc2323de88e6e9361710ff3b06c5cbdc88", "ja": "ワケアリのごろつき達が慕っているのも、\nそういうところがあるからなのかもしれないわ。", "zh": "那些有着复杂背景的混混们会仰慕她，或许也是因为她有这样的一面吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d2562542d2e324704fa1c14d7a5c2dd2120be99a17fa3db3f8a22c32031a9c8d", "ja": "なるほど……。改めてそう考えると、\nやはりこの役はこのみさんにピッタリでしたね。", "zh": "原来如此……。重新这么一想，\n这个角色果然还是最适合木实小姐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "a79cd79051b0d6a2ce012182320cdb912f5c3166fd508730758da6720cc6e83b", "ja": "えっ？　それは……嬉しいけど、言い過ぎじゃない？\n私、こんなにカッコよくないもの。", "zh": "诶？这……虽然很开心，但是不是说得太过了？\n我可没那么帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ecf4c5fbcb8acfa081507d50509a5e70326b8a53a99812dad99afbaa2a18d800", "ja": "いえ、そんなことないですよ。みんなのこと、\nいつも気にかけてくれたり。艦長っぽいと思います。", "zh": "没有那回事。你总是很照顾\n大家，我觉得很有舰长的风范。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "f59877fb101f6a20a2d53c1659accd5ca1c55ddf552d7eddf101985ed9e512ac", "ja": "あら、ウフフ……♪　でも私、年長者なんだから。\nそれくらい、当然のことだと思うわ。", "zh": "哎呀，呵呵……♪　不过我毕竟是年长者嘛。\n这点小事，我觉得理所当然啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b806cb356f8eb8440d513b583a8eaad46496990720005ef3c8f48afe515b4575", "ja": "このみさんのそういうところには、\nいつも助けてもらっています。でも……", "zh": "我一直都受到这个美奈子的帮助。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1014_p", "source_sha256": "39243fdb338ddc27bbfaf1db12e6a994522351a13510321d434d59f7d0084214", "ja": "今日の撮影は、\nもう少しだけワガママになってください。", "zh": "今天的拍摄，请再稍微任性一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "bf1279b8794a41db0bafa484f6cf3de02f7ba08bc3083c0f585bb049a736bc65", "ja": "えっ、ワガママに……？", "zh": "诶，要再任性一点……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7264763fdde725ce549c9c8efd578d257296aad4efd3d1924cd314d2e91083f9", "ja": "ええ。みんなの面倒を見たり、\n気を遣ったりするのは、任せてもらって。", "zh": "没错。照顾大家、替大家操心这些事，就交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1017_p", "source_sha256": "65020cc49176148bcdeec24da6dfece23ce5efc4ea36c6809a5074bca78e747b", "ja": "主役を食うくらいの活躍を、見せて欲しいんです！\nそんなこのみさんを、見てみたいんです。", "zh": "我希望您能拿出足以盖过主角的精彩表现！\n我想看看那样的这个美小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "0925b1df08cd017cea20025bf99fcb30438a33fda170b8195f9f4484e1e9d5e3", "ja": "{$P$}……ウフフ♪\nわかったわ！　ありがとう。", "zh": "{$P$}……呵呵♪\n明白了！谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "f7694222104876156914758865ec25a43ac0f0c7dab65a9f5b2ab342d1ec67ac", "ja": "それじゃ、お言葉に甘えて、\n今日は思いっきりやらせてもらっちゃうわね！", "zh": "那么，我就恭敬不如从命，\n今天可要尽情拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "27d29f2dd528e100427669e1413fbd3a7488bf74c1bf6a3609957d3c5fcdaa0d", "ja": "あっ、でもそれなら……さっそくひとつ、\nワガママを言わせてもらっちゃってもいいかしら？", "zh": "啊，不过既然这样……那我就马上提一个要求，可以满足我这个任性的请求吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2d85b9ebcdc7023070428ac49dd1abb939727e6ef89cbf2c5005a8024ce444b4", "ja": "はい！　なんですか？", "zh": "好的！是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "5876d0c33f62d4a432a7939b57bac36526eb1dd67ff5e38eda40e60ec5c77f5a", "ja": "ウフフ♪　それは……{$P$}も、\nできる限り、楽しむこと！", "zh": "呵呵♪ 那就是……{$P$}也要尽情享受，做到自己能做到的最大限度！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "5a50d81e4eb4eed79611cd4a8ccf30f9542a707d27d97c781765e4af02aca39e", "ja": "私にとっては、あなたも大切なクルーなんだから。\n一緒に冒険を楽しみましょ！　ね♪", "zh": "对我来说，你也是重要的船员啊。一起享受冒险吧！好吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0374_1024_p", "source_sha256": "66a539a6c36df9ff96fb0c58e57454324fe084d6e734dfa819bab8f3693dcf26", "ja": "（ワガママでありながら、気遣いもできる……\nコノミ艦長は、まさにハマり役だな！）", "zh": "（任性却又会体贴人……木实舰长真是再合适不过了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
